
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<meta name="description" content="Premium Himalayan Pink Salt from Pakistan. Bulk supply and export for international buyers.">
<title>Himalayan Salt Export | Pakistan</title>

<style>
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
body{font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background:#100e0d;color:white}
header{padding:22px 8%;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;background:#181311}
.logo{font-size:22px;font-weight:bold;color:#f5b5a9}
nav a{color:white;text-decoration:none;margin-left:20px}
.hero{min-height:85vh;display:flex;align-items:center;padding:60px 8%;
background:linear-gradient(90deg,#170f0c,#170f0cdd),url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1518110925495-5fe2fda0442b?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400') center/cover}
.hero h1{font-size:52px;max-width:650px;margin-bottom:20px}
.hero h1 span{color:#f2a999}
.hero p{color:#ddd;font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;max-width:550px}
.btn{display:inline-block;margin-top:28px;padding:15px 28px;background:#c87969;color:white;text-decoration:none;border-radius:7px}
section{padding:75px 8%;text-align:center}
h2{font-size:34px;margin-bottom:20px;color:#f2b2a3}
.cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr));gap:25px;margin-top:35px}
.card{background:#241b18;padding:25px;border-radius:15px;border:1px solid #49332d}
.card h3{color:#f2b2a3;margin:15px}
.card p{color:#ccc;line-height:1.6}
.about{background:#1b1513}
footer{background:#0b0908;padding:35px;text-align:center;color:#aaa}
@media(max-width:600px){
.hero h1{font-size:36px}
nav a{margin-left:8px;font-size:12px}
header{padding:20px 4%}
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
<div class="logo">HIMALAYAN SALT</div>
<nav>
<a href="#home">Home</a>
<a href="#products">Products</a>
<a href="#about">About</a>
<a href="#contact">Contact</a>
</nav>
</header>

<div class="hero" id="home">
<div>
<h1>Premium <span>Himalayan Pink Salt</span> From Pakistan</h1>
<p>Discover premium Himalayan pink salt from Pakistan. We aim to serve international buyers, wholesalers and distributors with bulk supply and export solutions.</p>
<a href="#contact" class="btn">Contact Us</a>
</div>
</div>

<section id="products">
<h2>Our Products</h2>
<p>Explore our Himalayan salt product range.</p>
<div class="cards">
<div class="card">
<h3>Pink Salt Crystals</h3>
<p>Natural Himalayan pink salt crystals for different applications.</p>
</div>
<div class="card">
<h3>Pink Salt Powder</h3>
<p>Finely ground pink salt for food and seasoning applications.</p>
</div>
<div class="card">
<h3>Salt Chunks</h3>
<p>Himalayan salt chunks for various commercial uses.</p>
</div>
<div class="card">
<h3>Bulk Supply</h3>
<p>Bulk supply options for wholesalers and international buyers.</p>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="about" id="about">
<h2>About Our Business</h2>
<p>We are focused on supplying Himalayan Pink Salt sourced from Pakistan to international markets. Our goal is to build reliable business relationships with buyers worldwide.</p>
</section>

<section id="contact">
<h2>Let's Work Together</h2>
<p>Interested in wholesale orders or export inquiries?</p>
<a href="mailto:YOUR-EMAIL@example.com" class="btn">Email Us</a>
</section>

<footer>
<p>© 2026 Himalayan Salt Export | Pakistan</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
